window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-115-e134cff9b69e2c5a.json"]={sha256:"e134cff9b69e2c5ace707de78481cab77444fcea70016ea5998cdb241798cec6",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-10a555d6f37b1296","url":"https://www.bluetooth.com/learn-about-bluetooth/topology-options/le-mesh/mesh-faq/","title":"Bluetooth mesh networking FAQs","titleEn":"Bluetooth mesh networking FAQs","publisher":"Bluetooth SIG","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-115","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-115","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-116","referenceUrls":["https://www.ieee802.org/15/"],"title":"IEEE 802.15.4 CSMA：隨機退避與競爭窗口","titleEn":"IEEE802.15.4 CSMA: random backoff and contention window","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 3.5 ms aggregate airtime 與 5.5 ms aggregate airtime，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 3.5 ms aggregate airtime and 5.5 ms aggregate airtime, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋1120 microsecond與4960 microsecond，建立csma_backoff.csv、CCA結果、平均/最大等待，並完成以下驗收：3 ms平均退避預算僅BE3符合，但不能據此要求在擁擠媒介永遠使用小窗口。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 1120 microsecond and 4960 microsecond; create csma_backoff.csv, CCA outcomes and mean/max waiting; apply this acceptance decision: OnlyBE3 fits a3 ms mean-backoff budget; that does not justify always using a small window in congestion.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 受控泛洪以中繼、重複抑制與TTL限制擴散；傳輸次數不是唯一節點數，去重仍不可省。 展開基準式 (1+3*2)*0.5；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：用message_id、relay_id、repeat_index枚舉7與11次；確認接收應用只交付一次。 將兩條推導一起存入 mesh_relays.csv、去重鍵、TTL逐跳紀錄。","從原理 均勻退避整數0至2^BE-1的平均為(2^BE-1)/2；只估等待，未加入CCA、碰撞與重試。 展開基準式 (2**3-1)/2*320；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：枚舉0..7及0..31，再用首末平均交叉驗證；分清平均等待與最大等待。 將兩條推導一起存入 csma_backoff.csv、CCA結果、平均/最大等待。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Managed flooding uses relays, duplicate suppression and TTL; transmission count differs from unique-node count and deduplication remains necessary., expand baseline expression (1+3*2)*0.5; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Enumerate7/11 transmissions by message_id, relay_id and repeat_index; confirm one application delivery. Save both derivations with mesh_relays.csv, deduplication keys and per-hop TTL trace.","Starting from Uniform integer backoff0 through2^BE-1 has mean(2^BE-1)/2; this estimates waiting before CCA, collisions and retries., expand baseline expression (2**3-1)/2*320; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Enumerate0..7 and0..31 and cross-check with endpoint means; distinguish mean from maximum waiting. Save both derivations with csma_backoff.csv, CCA outcomes and mean/max waiting.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-125","referenceUrls":["https://starlink.com/technology"],"title":"Starlink LEO：傳播時間與地面路徑分離","titleEn":"Starlink LEO: separating propagation from terrestrial path time","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 3.5 ms aggregate airtime 與 5.5 ms aggregate airtime，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 3.5 ms aggregate airtime and 5.5 ms aggregate airtime, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋15.3333333333 ms one-way lower estimate與19.3333333333 ms one-way lower estimate，建立leo_segments.csv、閘道路由版本、單向/往返對照，並完成以下驗收：18 ms單向傳播預算僅第一例可行；鏈路速率與處理延遲仍未驗證。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 15.3333333333 ms one-way lower estimate and 19.3333333333 ms one-way lower estimate; create leo_segments.csv, gateway-route versions and one-way/RTT labels; apply this acceptance decision: Only the first fits an18 ms one-way propagation budget; link rate and processing delay remain unverified.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 受控泛洪以中繼、重複抑制與TTL限制擴散；傳輸次數不是唯一節點數，去重仍不可省。 展開基準式 (1+3*2)*0.5；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：用message_id、relay_id、repeat_index枚舉7與11次；確認接收應用只交付一次。 將兩條推導一起存入 mesh_relays.csv、去重鍵、TTL逐跳紀錄。","從原理 LEO接入只占端到端延遲的一部分；終端—衛星—閘道幾何、地面回程與排隊必須分開。 展開基準式 2*800/300000*1000+10；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：按段加總並保留單向標記；不可把此數字與ping RTT直接比較或當目前Starlink服務保證。 將兩條推導一起存入 leo_segments.csv、閘道路由版本、單向/往返對照。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Managed flooding uses relays, duplicate suppression and TTL; transmission count differs from unique-node count and deduplication remains necessary., expand baseline expression (1+3*2)*0.5; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Enumerate7/11 transmissions by message_id, relay_id and repeat_index; confirm one application delivery. Save both derivations with mesh_relays.csv, deduplication keys and per-hop TTL trace.","Starting from LEO access is only part of end-to-end delay; terminal/satellite/gateway geometry, terrestrial backhaul and queues need separate budgets., expand baseline expression 2*800/300000*1000+10; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Sum labeled segments; do not compare the one-way estimate directly with ping RTT or present it as a current Starlink guarantee. Save both derivations with leo_segments.csv, gateway-route versions and one-way/RTT labels.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-3ac53e48703d7dee","url":"https://www.ieee802.org/15/","title":"IEEE 802.15 working group","titleEn":"IEEE 802.15 working group","publisher":"IEEE 802.15 Working Group","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-55cc9e29b41f2663","url":"https://starlink.com/technology","title":"Starlink satellite technology","titleEn":"Starlink satellite technology","publisher":"SpaceX / Starlink","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
